24	/* One pair per foreground; the background stays whatever the terminal
25	 * already uses, so the panels sit in the player's own colour scheme.
26	 *
27	 * Nothing is carried by colour alone. Every cell is a distinct glyph
28	 * and every coloured status value also spells its state out in words,
29	 * so a player who cannot tell red from green reads exactly what a
30	 * monochrome terminal shows. Keep it that way. */
